  "deferredToMc2": [
    "Matching against a captured TargetContract. A contract describes one real instance, and MC-1 makes no vendor call; P11 and P12 therefore exercise the target shape and the association mechanics under CREATE_ONLY, as do FOUNDING-HUBSPOT-1M and FOUNDING-SALESFORCE-1M, and MC-2 adds matching against evidence it captures. Every profile here runs under CREATE_ONLY with no contract, which is what lets the capacity harness be run by anybody on any machine."
